  unitName: Skalmold (EU)
  unitId: 710113
  unitNumber: 7020
  description: Part of the pantheon of fierce warriors coming from the coldest territories
    of Grand Gaia. Their legend tells us that 6 exceptional semi-goddesses select
    among the best of dying combatants, whom would be granted the right to enter
    their heaven and fight side by side with the gods. Skalmold has a puzzling personality.
    She can fight amongst the forces of evil one day and be found slaying a demon
    the next. Dying warriors sometimes catch a glimpse of the flaming sword she received
    as a gift from her divine suitor before entering heaven.
  summonDesc: Feel my wrath, feel my fury!
  fusionDesc: As you feed my anger, I become stronger!
